# Figma → code workflow

Figma file: **Website-Julia**, fileKey `mz08gQQzJrizSqgUvdmxgw`.
Pages: `Design` (`0:1`), `Components` (`74:417`).

## Budget first

Figma MCP limits depend on whose Figma account Cursor is signed in with. The file is owned by
"Julia's Starter team" (Professional plan): a Full/Dev seat there gets 200 read calls/day and 10/min;
a View/Collab seat gets only 20/month. Either way, cached docs are faster than MCP calls.
1. Read `docs/design-system.md` and `docs/screens/<screen>.md` first. They contain tokens,
   the component map and node ids. Do **not** call Figma for anything listed there.
2. Call Figma only when the user gives a node link, or a spec says the node changed.
3. Per screen: 1× `get_metadata` (only if no spec exists) → `get_design_context` on **leaf sections**
   (never a whole 1440 frame: case frames are 10–16k px tall) → 1× `get_screenshot` for the final check.
   Don't fire more than ~8 calls in a row (10/min limit).
4. Don't call `get_variable_defs` again unless the user says variables changed.
5. After any Figma read, write what you learned into `docs/screens/<screen>.md`.
6. `get_design_context` returns React + Tailwind. Never copy Tailwind classes; translate to SCSS with tokens.
   Its asset URLs expire in 7 days: download into `public/projects/<case>/`, never reference them.

## Tokens (never hardcode)

Token partials in `src/styles/` (`@use` order: colors, typography, spacing, sizes — see `scss-tokens.mdc`):
- `_colors.scss` — Figma `Main` = `$accent`, `Text` = `$text`, `Background` (#f3f3f4) = `$paper`
  (in Figma it is the *light text on dark*, not a page background). Hardcoded Figma colors:
  `#ededef` → `$bg` / `$surface-muted`, raw `#1c1c1c` → `$surface-inverse`, `#5d5d5d` → `$footer-line`,
  `#f6f6f6` (light text on case pages) → use `$paper`, don't add a new token without asking.
- `_typography.scss` — 1440 values only. Figma `Section title` 72 = `$font-size-projects`
  (NOT `$font-size-section`, which is 56). `Content Title` 40 = `$font-size-case-heading`.
  `Case title` 80 = `$font-size-case-title`. `Body` 18 = `$font-size-case-body`. `Tag` 16 = `$font-size-base`.
- `_spacing.scss`, `_sizes.scss` — measured values; Figma has no spacing variables.
- `_breakpoints.scss` — `$bp-desktop` 1440, `$bp-laptop` 1200, `$bp-tablet` 1024, `$bp-stack` 768,
  plus code-only `$bp-single` 599, `$bp-phone` 479. Figma 390 frame = literal `390px`.
  Bridge sizes between frames with `fluid($from, $to, $from-vp, $to-vp)`, desktop-first `max-width` queries.

Rules:
- Map every Figma hex / px to an existing token. If none exists, add a token to the right partial
  (semantic name) and say so in the summary. Never paste hex values into component SCSS.
- Case brand palettes are content: put them in `src/constants/cases/<case>.ts`, not in `_colors.scss`.
- Figma text styles are `Min Sans` Medium 500 / Regular 400, letter-spacing 0.
- Ignore Figma absolute x/y. Rebuild layout with flex/grid + spacing tokens.

## Component map (reuse, don't regenerate)

| Figma | Code |
|---|---|
| `Header` (`Appearance`, `Breakpoint`, `Show about`) | `src/components/Header/Header.tsx`: `Appearance=Dark` → `tone="default"`, `Light` → `tone="inverse"`; `Show about` → nothing |
| `Contacts` (`Appearance`, `Breakpoint`) | `src/components/Footer/Footer.tsx`: `Light` → `tone="light"`, `Dark` → `tone="inverse"` (contains `Contacts`) |
| `Project Card` (`Project title`, `Show tag 3`) | `src/components/ProjectCard/ProjectCard.tsx` + data in `src/constants/projects.ts` |
| `Cover image` (`Project`=…) | `src/components/ProjectCard/ProjectVisual.tsx`, via `project.image.kind` / `crop` |
| `Tag` (`Text`, `Appearance`, `Size`) | `<li>` in `.tags` (ProjectCard) / `.case-tags` (CaseIntro) — no component yet |
| Figma `Breakpoint=*` variants | never a prop; responsive CSS only |
| `Project Header` frame on case pages | `CaseIntro` (section type `intro`) |

Case pages are data-driven: add sections to `src/constants/cases/<case>.ts` using types from
`src/constants/projectCase.ts`; rendering goes through `ProjectCase.tsx` → `Case*.tsx`.
Existing section components: CaseIntro, CaseMedia, CaseComparison, CaseSplit, CasePalette, CaseMarks,
CasePoster, CaseCluster, CaseStagger, CaseBanner, CaseNote, CaseLogoStack, CaseLogoPair,
CaseIconBoard, CaseTypefaces, CaseRelated (+ CaseFrame, CaseWordmarkLogo).
Per-case overrides go to `src/components/ProjectCase/_<case>.scss` with a `.case-page--<id>` modifier
(add the id in `ProjectCase.tsx` `caseModifier`). Keep files < 1000 lines (`file-size.mdc`).

Before creating a new component or section type: search `src/components/` and
`src/constants/projectCase.ts` and reuse/extend.

## Images

- Don't use Figma MCP asset URLs in code. Put optimized files in `public/projects/<case>/`
  (`npm run optimize:images` → WebP) and reference with `withBaseUrl("projects/<case>/<file>")`.
- Always set `width`/`height`, `alt`, `loading="lazy"` (except the first/LCP image).

## Done checklist

- Compare with `get_screenshot` (or a screenshot the user pasted) at 1440, 768, 390.
- `npm run lint`, `npm test`, `npm run build` pass.
- Update `docs/screens/<screen>.md` and, if tokens changed, `docs/design-system.md`.
